				1191,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct import path for URI normalization utility\n\nResolve a broken import path in `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Extensions.rs` where the `Normalize` module was referenced incorrectly. Update the path from `IPC::UriComponents::Normalize` to `IPC::UriComponents::Normalize::Fn` to align with the actual module structure and expose the normalization function required for processing extension URIs.\n\nThis ensures the extension management handlers can correctly resolve URI components during the filtering of installed extensions, preventing potential runtime panics or logic errors when interacting with the `Wind` service layer.",
			"SHA": "27f727498c52bb68469eda25b9df43e452c463e8"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T09:06:51Z",
